WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.897
Welcome to the physics fundamentals lab.

00:00:01.897 --> 00:00:05.692
We will take the big ideas of physics one at a time.

00:00:05.692 --> 00:00:07.905
Each one starts with a concept card.

00:00:07.905 --> 00:00:12.016
Then you predict, watch the experiment, and explain it in your own words.
